---
description: Editing .tex files
globs: ["**/*.tex"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Keep lines as paragraphs (soft wrap). One sentence per line is fine if the author already does it.
- Do not add packages in chapter files; add them to `preamble/packages.tex`.
- Use `~` before `\ref`, `\cite`, and between numbers and units. Use `---` for em dashes, `--` for ranges.
- Leave `% TODO` / `\todo{}` markers in place.
